{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you awake, or still dreaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re on a bus, trying to reach your next stop. But every time you close your eyes, reality shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s a nightmare?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Look for clues</strong> to figure out if you're still dreaming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make the right choices</strong> to escape\u2014or stay trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face unpredictable nightmares</strong> where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598840/extras/ss_030357e5e035ebab651a219a9a79cf4c35fb628d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742984959\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playtime<strong>:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598840/extras/ss_dbc6b955d98253472a554e75b93f86fb398e2a59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742984959\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0Difficulty Levels:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy:</strong> 1 minute before each blink. Sitting in a chair gives you more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal:</strong> 1 minute before each blink. Escaping a nightmare might lead to another one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insanity:</strong> Every failed escape throws you into a new nightmare. Escaping one brings you back to the last\u2014stay focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598840/extras/ss_c37f391a09d26c6bee26d012dc1956348a4d0ab0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742984959\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Demo content:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience Normal Difficulty Mode</strong> (Easy and Insanity are available in the full game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play up to 4,500 meters</strong> of the journey before the demo ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Nightmares</strong> \u2013 Experience a small selection of the nightmare sequences from the full game.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598840?t=1742984959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598840?t=1742984959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598840/4e18118a4d157b600c4a2326ea0a76698b208565/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742984959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598840/4e18118a4d157b600c4a2326ea0a76698b208565/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742984959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you awake, or still dreaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re on a bus, trying to reach your next stop. But every time you close your eyes, reality shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s a nightmare?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Look for clues</strong> to figure out if you're still dreaming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make the right choices</strong> to escape\u2014or stay trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face unpredictable nightmares</strong> where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c